Tracing de agentes.ejemplo:
from langfuse.decorators import observe
@observe(as_type="generation")
def llamar_llm(prompt: str):
    return client.chat.completions.create(model="gpt-4o-mini", messages=[{"role":"user","content":prompt}])

Vector DB (pgvector, Pinecone, Weaviate,.ejemplo:
-- Índice HNSW y consulta coseno en pgvector (PostgreSQL)
CREATE INDEX ON chunks USING hnsw (embedding vector_cosine_ops);
SELECT contenido, 1 - (embedding <=> $1) AS score
FROM chunks WHERE tenant_id = 'acme'
ORDER BY embedding <=> $1 LIMIT 5;
